WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:18.779
Brad: Now I understand why they call a tall building a skyscraper!

2
00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:22.165
Brad: I can’t even see the top of this one.

3
00:00:22.166 --> 00:00:28.191
Danny: Everything is so gray, you almost can’t see anything.

4
00:00:28.192 --> 00:00:31.205
Tina: So how do we find Hopian?

5
00:00:31.206 --> 00:00:34.091
Danny: I . . . don’t know.

6
00:00:34.092 --> 00:00:39.431
Brad: You mean, we came all this way, and you don’t know how to find him?

7
00:00:39.432 --> 00:00:42.376
Danny: I thought he’d be waiting for us.

8
00:00:42.377 --> 00:00:44.529
Tina: Well, he’s not.

9
00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:47.658
Danny: I’m sure we’ll figure something out.

10
00:00:47.659 --> 00:00:51.026
Brad: Look! Do you see what I see?

11
00:00:51.027 --> 00:00:53.067
Tina: I’m not sure.

12
00:00:53.068 --> 00:00:54.527
Brad: It’s a giant!

13
00:00:54.528 --> 00:00:56.242
Near that car.

14
00:00:56.243 --> 00:01:02.922
Danny: I see him!

15
00:01:02.923 --> 00:01:06.100
Tina: Let’s go over and talk to him!

16
00:01:06.101 --> 00:01:13.097
Brad: Yeah! Maybe he knows where Hopian is.

17
00:01:13.098 --> 00:01:16.302
Danny: Hi. My name is Danny.

18
00:01:16.303 --> 00:01:20.569
We’re . . . um . . . we’re looking for a friend.

19
00:01:20.570 --> 00:01:25.098
Danny: He’s a giant like you.

20
00:01:25.099 --> 00:01:27.514
Tina: His name is Hopian.

21
00:01:27.515 --> 00:01:37.465
Brad: Do you know him?

22
00:01:37.466 --> 00:01:40.610
Tina: Oh no! Don’t cry.

23
00:01:40.611 --> 00:01:43.044
Danny: Did we say something bad?

24
00:01:43.045 --> 00:01:46.346
Brad: I think he was hoping for red paint.

25
00:01:46.347 --> 00:01:48.315
Tina: It’s okay, Mr. Giant.

26
00:01:48.316 --> 00:01:59.652
Just tell us where Hopian is.

27
00:01:59.653 --> 00:02:05.705
Danny: Remember, Hopian said that without color [n3@all the giants were getting sad.

28
00:02:05.706 --> 00:02:09.161
Brad: Well, I don’t think he’s going to be much help.

29
00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:18.055
Tina: I think we should leave him alone.

30
00:02:18.056 --> 00:02:20.244
Brad: What is it?

31
00:02:20.245 --> 00:02:21.875
Tina: I don’t know.

32
00:02:21.876 --> 00:02:24.885
I had a funny feeling.

33
00:02:24.886 --> 00:02:28.825
Danny: Well, something funny would be nice right now.

34
00:02:28.826 --> 00:02:33.946
Tina: Look! That’s not funny, but it sure is weird.

35
00:02:33.947 --> 00:02:37.230
Danny: What’s so weird?

36
00:02:37.231 --> 00:02:40.005
Tina: I see something red.

37
00:02:40.006 --> 00:02:46.220
Brad: Maybe it means we should stop.

38
00:02:46.221 --> 00:02:49.454
Tina: It just became a stop sign!

39
00:02:49.455 --> 00:02:51.512
Danny: Can it hear us?

40
00:02:51.513 --> 00:02:53.393
Brad: Let’s find out.

41
00:02:53.394 --> 00:02:58.360
Can you hear us?

42
00:02:58.361 --> 00:03:07.453
Tina: It can! Do you know Hopian?

43
00:03:07.454 --> 00:03:09.640
Danny: It does!

44
00:03:09.641 --> 00:03:15.590
Brad: Can you take us to Hopian?

45
00:03:15.591 --> 00:03:17.566
Danny: What does that mean?

46
00:03:17.567 --> 00:03:24.812
Tina: I think it means we’re supposed to follow it.

47
00:03:24.813 --> 00:03:29.616
Danny: I told you this wouldn’t be difficult.
